<div class="u-prose">
  <h2>Before you drop off a repair</h2>
  <p>Bring the piece in a soft pouch if you have one. We log it at the counter, take a photo, and give you a ticket with the job number.</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Most resizes take three to five days.</li>
    <li>Stone setting can take up to two weeks.</li>
  </ul>
  <h3>At the counter</h3>
  <ol>
    <li>We check the piece with you and note any wear.</li>
    <li>We take a photo for the job.</li>
    <li>You get a ticket with a number like <code>#1042</code>.</li>
  </ol>
  <blockquote>
    <p>Keep your ticket. You need it to pick up the piece.</p>
  </blockquote>
  <h3>What it costs</h3>
  <p>You get a quote before we start. Nothing is charged until you <strong>approve it</strong>.</p>
